{*
	A number printed through |number with one argument, and a script whose braces
	are left alone because of n:syntax="off". Nothing in this file may be underlined.
*}
{varType float $ratio}
<meter value="{$ratio}">{$ratio|number:1}</meter>
<script n:syntax="off">
	const options = {low: 1, high: 9};
</script>
